# openOODA x86 SSA Post-Fix Smoke Probe — static projection of the per-block remap fix impact.

Logline: Estimates the post-fix SSA ASM-FAIL rate for the 6,936-fixture hostile-probe set by static analysis of `ooda/oodac/x86_ssa_emit.oo` and the v2 probe numbers, without re-running the 3-hour probe.

Setup: Binary `ooda/oodac_bin` rebuilt after the per-block remap fix. The v2 probe (x86-hostile-probe-v2.oot) found 6,426/6,936 SSA ASM-FAIL (92.6%), traceable to two construction bugs in x86_ssa_emit.oo. The fix landed in the same file; this doc projects the new rate without a 3-hour re-run.

Beats:
  1. Recap the pre-fix SSA ASM-FAIL breakdown from x86-hostile-probe-v2.oot §3.
  2. Walk the v2 source of x86_ssa_emit.oo and identify the lines that target each root cause.
  3. Estimate the post-fix count for each root cause with the reasoning.
  4. List the new failure modes the fix might introduce.
  5. State the expected new SSA ASM-FAIL rate and the confidence level.

